{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99ee1155c6b02e43c5086dd74344e6b9ba5ba37f518a2691a5dd835d60cc502a", "ja": "（今日の野外ライブは大成功だったな！　あとは伊織を\n送って帰るだけだが……遅いな。大丈夫かな）", "zh": "（今天的户外演唱会非常成功！再来只剩下\n送伊织回家……但她一直没出现，是怎么了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "967e5fe82883c40f12f0c57070c762283f309ae884576cbfc9a18aa106b01b09", "ja": "ふぅ……。あ、お待たせ、{$P$}。\nさ、帰りましょうか。", "zh": "呼……啊，{$P$}，久等了。\n来，我们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5fc6a4fb26a95493ab7e14ddd190d58a0434a7ff450ea2cce2a49f0c146b2f6", "ja": "ああ、伊織、お疲れさま。\n思ったより時間かかったみたいだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，伊织，辛苦了。\n你花的时间比我想像的还久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "b81e1c8100ab32151d93685b281b4674cedfc9c559f85a521e5bb9872ffca3d3", "ja": "あら、レディの身支度に文句があるわけ？\nいろいろあるのよ、いろいろ。", "zh": "哎呀，你是在抱怨淑女整理仪容很花时间吗？\n我们要做的事可多了，多得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1004_p", "source_sha256": "39d5c8e104b209221ab82bcfecd5aac2ce7e16c9e11753e56dab01c39f8e5176", "ja": "いろいろ……。", "zh": "多得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "e49fff5d7bab5f6b89c72ff0a88125e6d6cdeacc581d467f4bac52a28516731a", "ja": "なによ、分かってないわねぇ。今日みたいな\n野外ステージのあとは、スキンケアが大変なのよ？", "zh": "唉，你很迟钝耶。像今天这样在户外\n表演完后，可是需要好好保养肌肤的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "290eaa29558092ca344a77d3fb9778f2b45b103ba542f75a4d4377f283953eb0", "ja": "メイク落とすだけでも一苦労だし、\nお肌だってピリピリして痛いんだから。", "zh": "光是卸妆就要费上一番工夫，\n就连肌肤都晒到刺痛了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ea935849d910456d648437cc16e780146acdecd39c98f3d5017f477116cb5609", "ja": "あれ？　でも日焼け止め塗ってるんだろ？\nそれでも痛いのか？", "zh": "奇怪？你不是有擦防晒乳吗？\n这样还是会晒伤吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "a4a1bdc1853b128a26b49ab43676dcee152ae35658cebcd8242319f78f3c159c", "ja": "そんなに万能じゃないわ。汗で落ちちゃうし。\nお肌に負担がかかるから、そんなに厚くも塗れないし。", "zh": "那个才没那么万能，流过汗就会掉了，\n而且也会对肌肤造成负担，不能擦得太厚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "ef181a38f18d50b444133820192a55e0587fb914f06a7668c2ca33aceb6ab676", "ja": "だからステージ後のお手入れは、手が抜けないの。\n私もみんなも、いつも大変なんだから。", "zh": "所以表演完后的保养绝对不能偷懒。\n我和大家每次都费了很多心力耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1010_p", "source_sha256": "44ef31a54f2bc4efe38120a544740791c3653379179500d5036a5b768b2eec53", "ja": "そうなのか。キレイな肌を保つのも大変なんだな……。\nなにか俺に、手伝えることってあるかな？", "zh": "原来是这样，想维持漂亮的肌肤也不容易呢……\n有没有什么是我帮得上忙的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "10c8139e7b30c4e8bd0c71c281c6324a4c74b5122d399116191ca562a32dc23a", "ja": "あら、いい心がけじゃない。うーん、そうね。\nちょっとした洗顔グッズなんかは楽屋に欲しいわね。", "zh": "哎呀，你挺有心的嘛。嗯……我想想，\n希望休息室可以放一些脸部清洁用品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "0a66436fb0e78132cef3bd9e99576a70f753c8b0e146770ebec5dae3498bfaac", "ja": "私は大丈夫だけど、よく忘れる子もいるもの。\nあと保湿液とフェイスマスクと……。", "zh": "我虽然都会自备，但也有人常忘记带。\n还有保湿液、面膜跟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "405b1d134d959f2d36ec173e82d807ec90cfec669156ef410ae6b9aec004a556", "ja": "それから、そうね……。あ！\nオレンジジュースがあるといいわ。", "zh": "另外就是，我想一下……啊！\n最好还要有柳橙汁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5d0f9fd904bb29326042d2e9432fe4fc1fd9b99d1c0c4955da17b7c4cf0ca809", "ja": "ふむふむ……って、オレンジジュースは\nスキンケアに関係あるのか？", "zh": "嗯嗯……呃，\n柳橙汁跟保养肌肤有关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "2669646f69667d2cf2d7df7a6100089ab9c780bd32f7cdeebca833f081e5d431", "ja": "大ありよ。『オレンジジュースでビタミンCを効率よく\n摂りましょう』って……どこかで見たんだから。", "zh": "很有关系，『喝柳橙汁可以快速摄取维他命C』……\n我有看过这种讲法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1016_p", "source_sha256": "42cf986dcd81e2a8b8cdb4bd5241b14aaa064dca7353a1e7ebdff606c223534a", "ja": "なるほどな。いや、参考になったよ、ありがとう。\nよし！　さっそく、帰りにごちそうしよう。", "zh": "原来如此，的确很有参考价值，谢啦。\n那好！我回程时就请你喝一杯吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "d30eb658f6053223ddb39dab248b72ec169378c61e70f07b6798a8cc773b6d52", "ja": "あらそう？　それならいただこうかしら♪　\n……にひひっ。", "zh": "要请我喝？那我就不跟你客气啰♪\n……咿嘻嘻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8fba67b4f831cd403096b31da8b028b905c62cc98637483f909de761f1cb499f", "ja": "ん？　なにか言ったか？", "zh": "嗯？你有说什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0123_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "5a8fe657b512ef0f91d8391df48c0775cffc2ac8ce7ea8cd63469e0aa533540e", "ja": "ううん、なんでもないわ♪\nほら、行くわよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "不，什么事也没有♪\n好了，快走吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
